    <briefdescription>
<para>Functions in this group relate to the inspection and manipulation of individual instructions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>In the C++ API, an instruction is modeled by <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_instruction" kindref="compound">llvm::Instruction</ref>. This class has a large number of descendents. <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_instruction" kindref="compound">llvm::Instruction</ref> is a <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_value" kindref="compound">llvm::Value</ref> and in the C API, instructions are modeled by <ref refid="group___l_l_v_m_c_support_types_1ga113ce952344691b8304a43a314f8be17" kindref="member">LLVMValueRef</ref>.</para>
<para>This group also contains sub-groups which operate on specific <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_instruction" kindref="compound">llvm::Instruction</ref> types, e.g. <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_call_inst" kindref="compound">llvm::CallInst</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
  </compounddef>
